# The fourth tier (src/llm/) — the advisory explained in plain language.
# Nothing else in the app reads these, and the app works without them.
#
# You usually do NOT need this file: open the Profile tab in the app, pick a
# provider (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Groq, ...) and paste a key there. A key
# saved on the phone wins over anything below.
#
# These are the build-time fallback. Copy to `.env` and fill one of the two in.

# Preferred: a proxy you control holds the key, the app never sees it.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AEGIS_LLM_PROXY=https://your-proxy.example/v1

# Alternative for demo week: the key is compiled into the app bundle and can
# be extracted from the APK by anyone who downloads it. Rate-limit it.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
